## Why This Is Asked

Tests advanced operational mastery: scaling secret provisioning across thousands of tenants, safely rotating encryption keys with minimal disruption, and preserving strict isolation with auditable trails.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenant isolation and namespace scoping
- Automated secret rotation (Transit keys) with zero-downtime
- AppRole bindings per-tenant and per-app scope
- Rollback and audit integration during rotations

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-rotation orchestrator sketch
async function rotateTenantKeys(tenant) {
  await rotateTransitKey(tenant);
  await rebindAppRoles(tenant);
  await validateTenantTraffic(tenant);
}
```

